      "cooked": "<p>Upgraded to 16.10 today and am now getting these “Getting started” popups on the lower right of the screen. I click Skip All and close it but it pops up again a little while later. I figured maybe they were related to the onboarding setting (System Settings &gt; Enable Onboarding) so I unchecked this but it hasn’t helped. Starting to get a little annoying. Anyone know how to get rid of these?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/7/578b1c9101515b6b49480177b68766116d295ee6.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/578b1c9101515b6b49480177b68766116d295ee6\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/7/578b1c9101515b6b49480177b68766116d295ee6_2_423x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"curAhf5kBMPvn6UE1Wdz5mwyefs\" width=\"423\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/7/578b1c9101515b6b49480177b68766116d295ee6_2_423x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/7/578b1c9101515b6b49480177b68766116d295ee6.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/7/578b1c9101515b6b49480177b68766116d295ee6.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F7F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">551×651 27.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
